    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7427" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναρτ-έομαι</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		 Verb, used only in pf.
		
			Pass.
		 (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτέομαι</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be ready, prepared</i> to do,
			c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναρτημένου σεῦ χρηστὰ ἔργα ποιέειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.90
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναρτημένος ἔρδειν τινὰ κακῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.88
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάρτημαι ἐπ᾽ αὐτοὺς στρατεύεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					7.8
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ́.</span></div>
